WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.875
Lab 2 uses an OCI test
tenancy, never production.

2
00:00:03.875 --> 00:00:08.994
As an IAM administrator, add Oracle's one
policy statement for the reader's group,

3
00:00:08.994 --> 00:00:12.018
from a file so the shell
doesn't touch its quotes,

4
00:00:12.018 --> 00:00:14.500
and keep the policy's ID for the back-out.

5
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:18.201
Configure the CLI as the reader
with Oracle's setup command,

6
00:00:18.201 --> 00:00:19.862
which creates the key pair.

7
00:00:19.862 --> 00:00:23.951
Then cross-check: Oracle's own list
command counts the announcements,

8
00:00:23.951 --> 00:00:26.175
and the kit's collection should agree.

9
00:00:26.175 --> 00:00:31.162
Record the key casing the CLI printed,
because Oracle's reference doesn't show it.

10
00:00:31.162 --> 00:00:36.410
Finally, delete the policy and the run,
which names the tenancy's resources.
